<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The love of God poured out from God,</l><l>Through Christ into our hearts,</l><l>Is nothing less than Christ Himself</l><l>Who spreads through all our parts.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>It covers, bends, endures all things,</l><l>Love’s strength to last is great;</l><l>The love of God, like none on earth,</l><l>Cannot discriminate.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
